## Glossary

**EMA** — Exponential Moving Average  
**PDE Loss** — Physics residual (how well the solution satisfies the PDE)  
**Data Loss** — Supervised loss (how well it fits ground truth)  
**Warmup** — Early training phase where one loss dominates  
**Ramp** — Scheduled increase in another loss's weight  
**Normalization** — Dividing loss by a scale factor to keep gradients O(1)

